    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="version_format">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">Weather data comes from Open-Meteo using the ECMWF IFS HRES model, a global 9 km forecast updated every 6 hours.\n\nData is licensed under CC BY 4.0. The free Open-Meteo tier is for non-commercial use.\n\nThe weather background colours come from Breezy Weather (ui-weather-view), used under the GNU LGPL v3.\n\nWeather icons are by Google, from the google-weather-icons collection by mrdarrengriffin.</string>
